# Sorting Rock's cellar under the rock (CIPlay sorting_rock_caves, 11-12 w12 prep; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe (the origin frame): the cellar knoll hw_mount at 58 14 (b 17, h 22, foot 4.84 m); kit_dig mouth at 40 14
# (way in = +x), 3 m level to 43 14, the tunnel to 55 14, the chamber to 61 14; zone sr_cellar at 54 14. Floor ~4.84 (a guess).
# Offline-written, never run; the offset is the old one - re-read it after the build (the knoll may move the land centre).
island Sorting Rock keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

# The knoll and the mouth from outside
picture sr_cellar_out 24 +3 14 40 +1.5 14
picture sr_cellar_side 36 +3 28 42 +1.5 14

# In along the tunnel to the chamber
# the boar in the cellar (11-12 mixed monsters): alive on the dug floor, under the rock
wait 3
expect animals Warthog 1
expect animalsinside Warthog 1
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0

walk 35 14 to 40 14 to 46 14 to 55 14 to 59 14
zone sr_cellar
picture sr_cellar_in 46 +2.5 14 59 +0.5 14 light=20

# Out again
walk 59 14 to 55 14 to 46 14 to 40 14 to 35 14
